    "raw_content_or_precise_summary": "This page is a scroll‑view interface for the digitized monograph \"The ring of Nestor\". It includes navigation instructions and a mini table of contents:\n\n- 
\"Titelblatt\" (title page).\n- \"1–42 I. Sepulchral treasure of gold signet‑rings and bead‑seals from Thisbê, Boeotia\".\n- \"43–75 II. A glimpse into the Minoan after‑world\".\n- \"Tafel I–V\" 
(plates).\n\nThe interface explains how to scroll, rotate images, zoom, and navigate between pages. Although the scroll page itself does not restate the content, it confirms the presence of the two major 
